                  \\,.
          %p
          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              One may also think of this as being the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/polynomial+functor"} polynomial functor
              associated with this span:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
